@Visitas.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5217
@VisitaId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@Codigo = XYZ123

### POST /api/visitas (Crear visita, rol: residente)
POST {{Visitas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visitas
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "viviendaId": 1,
  "nombreVisitante": "Juan",
  "apellidosVisitante": "Perez",
  "telefonoVisitante": "5551234567",
  "motivo": "personal",
  "numAcompanantes": 0,
  "vehiculoPlacas": "ABC-123",
  "notas": "Trae paquete",
  "fechaLlegadaEsperada": "2026-10-01T15:00:00Z",
  "horasVigencia": 12
}

### GET /api/visitas/mis-visitas (Listar mis visitas, rol: residente)
GET {{Visitas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visitas/mis-visitas?page=1&pageSize=10&estado=programada
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### PUT /api/visitas/{id} (Editar visita, rol: residente)
PUT {{Visitas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visitas/{{VisitaId}}
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nombreVisitante": "Juan Modificado",
  "numAcompanantes": 2
}

### POST /api/visitas/{id}/cancelar (Cancelar visita, rol: residente)
POST {{Visitas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visitas/{{VisitaId}}/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### GET /api/visitas/hoy (Listar visitas de hoy, rol: vigilancia/admin)
GET {{Visitas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visitas/hoy?page=1&pageSize=20&busqueda=Juan
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### GET /api/visitas/codigo/{codigo} (Validar código, rol: vigilancia/admin)
GET {{Visitas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visitas/codigo/{{Codigo}}
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### POST /api/visitas/{id}/entrada (Registrar entrada, rol: vigilancia)
POST {{Visitas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visitas/{{VisitaId}}/entrada
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### POST /api/visitas/{id}/salida (Registrar salida, rol: vigilancia)
POST {{Visitas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visitas/{{VisitaId}}/salida
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

### GET /api/visitas/historico (Histórico de visitas, rol: admin)
GET {{Visitas.Api_HostAddress}}/api/visitas/historico?page=1&pageSize=20&viviendaId=1&estado=finalizada
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
Accept: application/json
